Kea DHCP to Unbound DNS registration (DDNS edition)

Automatically registers DYNAMIC Kea DHCP leases in the Unbound DNS resolver
(forward A/AAAA + reverse PTR) so hostnames resolve as soon as a lease is issued.
DHCP reservations and Unbound Host Overrides are left to OPNsense — this plugin
only adds the dynamic-lease DNS that Kea + Unbound do not do natively.

This edition uses Kea's native Dynamic DNS output (kea-dhcp-ddns) feeding a
loopback RFC 2136 listener that writes records to Unbound. It does NOT patch any
of OPNsense's Kea MVC/PHP files: DDNS is configured globally and automatically,
TSIG authentication is auto-provisioned, and records persist across Unbound
restarts via an include file.

Requires OPNsense 26.1+ with Kea DHCP (v4 and/or v6) and Unbound as the resolver.

WWW: https://github.com/JameZUK/os-kea-unbound
